# ---------------------------------------------------------------- raw sources
# The original Gemini conversation exports are the source material for this
# project. They are DELIBERATELY NOT TRACKED.
#
# They contain personal and family information — the owner's full name, rental
# property details, and references to a family member's healthcare — that has no
# business in a git history that may be pushed to a remote.
#
# They remain on disk as the design record. If this repository is private and you
# want them versioned, delete the two lines below.
1-creating_Jarvis_database.md
17-Expanding_Jarvis_capabilities_Google_Gemini.md

